  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INT PEN &amp; WiPC 07-10</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">INT PEN &amp; WiPC 07-10</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International PEN is a memberbased global international civil society organisation working for freedom of expression. There are over 100 Centers globally, in some countries several depending on national challenges. Sida has supported PEN before and this agreement is a core support in accordance with the Paris Declaration, aiming at the development countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International PEN &#xE4;r en medlemsbaserad global NGO som arbetar f&#xF6;r yttrandefrihet, s&#xE4;rskilt f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;rfattare och journalister. Det finns &#xF6;ver nationella 100 PEN-Center i v&#xE4;rlden, varav en del arbetar i motvind. St&#xF6;det syftar till att st&#xE4;rka lokala PEN center och regional samverkan f&#xF6;r att st&#xE4;rka yttrandefrihet, l&#xE4;skunnighet och civilsamh&#xE4;llet. Sida har st&#xF6;tt PEN tidigare.</narrative>
  </description>
